# ==============================================================================
# AMPREX - GMAIL SMTP CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# To use Gmail for sending emails, follow these 2 quick steps:
#
# 1. GENERATE A GMAIL APP PASSWORD:
#    a. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/security
#    b. Ensure "2-Step Verification" is ON.
#    c. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    d. App name: Type "Amprex Website" -> Click Create.
#    e. Copy the 16-character code (e.g., abcd efgh ijkl mnop).
#
# 2. ADD THESE ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES TO VERCEL:
#    (Vercel Dashboard -> Your Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables)
# ==============================================================================

SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_SECURE=true
SMTP_USER=your-actual-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=abcdefghijklmnop
CONTACT_EMAIL=your-actual-email@gmail.com

# Note:
# - SMTP_USER: Your Gmail account (e.g. ahmedzulfiqar.dev@gmail.com)
# - SMTP_PASS: The 16-character Gmail App Password (NOT your regular login password!)
# - CONTACT_EMAIL: Where you want to receive new client inquiries and leads
